  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - (1)  The scheme will result in the loss of an on-street parking space within a controlled parking zone and thereby detract from the effectivenessof the C.P.Z.  The resulting conditions on the relevant sections of adjoining highways would thereby detract from the free flow of traffic and conditions of general safety for other road users, contrary to policy T.2.3 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan.\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - (2)  The scheme will result in the loss of a street tree and conversion of a garden area into hardstanding for vehicle parking.  This would not preserve or enhance the Turnham Green Conservation Area, contrary to policy ENV1.2 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan."
